<title>ITALY: Mondadori '96 cons net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Mondadori '96 cons net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			56     vs    68.5</p>
<p>    Parent net profit		    63.5   vs    65.1</p>
<p>    Ord div			     420 lire</p>
<p>    Savings div			 440 lire</p>
<p>    Cons sales			  2,194.7   (up 2 pct)</p>
<p>    Gross operating margin	    231.1   (up 12.4 pct)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    172.5   (up 11.6 pct)</p>
<p>    Net financial position	    157.6   vs    46.4</p>
<p>    Net equity			  1,022</p>
<p>Note - Publisher Mondadori is controlled by former prime minister Silvio Berlusconi's Fininvest group.</p>
</text>
